p;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 [&amp;_&gt;_*:last-child]:mb-0 print:block print:[&amp;_&gt;_:where(:not(:first-child))]:mt-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr">Perfect — semua 7 screenshot dah lengkap dan hasil dia betul-betul padan dengan yang kita nak:</p>
<ul dir="ltr" class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ Calico ready</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ Task 1 — pods/svc running</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ Task 2 — <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">HTTP 200</code> (before)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ Task 4 — <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">HTTP 000</code> (after NetworkPolicy)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ Task 3 — ResourceQuota applied</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ Task 5 — <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">yes</code> / <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">no</code> (RBAC scoping)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ Task 6 — <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">scan-done</code> / <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">wiped</code></li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr">Lab 2 dah <strong>fully documented dengan evidence lengkap</strong>. 🎉</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr">Sekarang upload ke GitHub. Ikut cara paling reliable (elak masalah drag-drop dalam text editor):</p></div></div><div data-find-omitted="" class="pl-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)] pt-4 pb-4"><div><div class="@container relative flex w-full flex-col overflow-hidden bg-surface-2 font-ui" style="border-radius: calc(var(--cds-radius) + 8px);"><ol role="list" class="flex flex-col"><li class="flex gap-sm px-xl pb-5 first:pt-xl"><span class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-neutral text-body font-medium text-secondary">1</span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-xs"><span class="flex min-h-7 items-center text-[16px] leading-[20px] font-medium text-primary">Create Lab2/README.md</span><span class="text-body text-secondary">Kat repo root, klik 'Add file' → 'Create new file'. Taip 'Lab2/README.md' dalam kotak nama (dengan slash, macam Lab0 tadi) — ini auto-create folder Lab2.</span></div></li><li class="flex gap-sm px-xl pb-5 first:pt-xl"><span class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-neutral text-body font-medium text-secondary">2</span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-xs"><span class="flex min-h-7 items-center text-[16px] leading-[20px] font-medium text-primary">Paste content README &amp; commit</span><span class="text-body text-secondary">Download README.md yang aku bagi tadi (file card kat atas chat), buka dengan Notepad, copy SEMUA content, paste dalam kotak besar editor GitHub. Scroll bawah, klik 'Commit changes'.</span></div></li><li class="flex gap-sm px-xl pb-5 first:pt-xl"><span class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-neutral text-body font-medium text-secondary">3</span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-xs"><span class="flex min-h-7 items-center text-[16px] leading-[20px] font-medium text-primary">Masuk folder Lab2, klik Upload files</span><span class="text-body text-secondary">Refresh, masuk folder 'Lab2' yang baru terbentuk. Klik 'Add file' → 'Upload files' (BUKAN Create new file kali ni, sebab ni gambar).</span></div></li><li class="flex gap-sm px-xl pb-5 first:pt-xl"><span class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-neutral text-body font-medium text-secondary">4</span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-xs"><span class="flex min-h-7 items-center text-[16px] leading-[20px] font-medium text-primary">Drag 7 gambar, commit</span><span class="text-body text-secondary">Drag semua 7 screenshot sekali gus, rename ikut nama yang README rujuk: setup-calico.png, task1-namespaces.png, task2-probe-http200.png, task3-resourcequota.png, task4-probe-blocked.png, task5-rbac-cani.png, task6-remanence.png. Commit.</span></div></li></ol><div class="pb-xl pr-xl" style="padding-left: calc(var(--cds-pad-xl) + 1.75rem + var(--cds-gap-sm));"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast focus-visible:shadow-focus text-primary font-normal aria-pressed:text-accent px-md"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish"><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-fill-secondary group-hover/btn:bg-fill-secondary-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-secondary-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent shadow-field"></span></span><span class="inline-fle